        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PNR150SMTSBR, 1-1/2\" Diameter Pioneer Brass Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSo named because it is a pioneer in today's design trends, the Brass Pioneer Door Pull has a modern look that makes it perfect for almost any home or commercial space. It can be thru-bolt mounted, surface mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass or metal doors. The Pioneer Pull is available in 18 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-pioneer-door-pull-first-impressions-pnr150smts4\"><b>Stainless Steel Pioneer Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions PNR150SMTSBR Pioneer Collection Series 1 Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-PNR01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262218\"><b>First Impressions PNR150SMTSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PNR150018SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.69\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PNR150024SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.69\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PNR150036SMTSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.69\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 8 feet. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
